    "detailed_description": "Explore the serene world of lab 83 with its lovely blades, spikes, boulders and more. Summon cubes for literally no reason to get through the death-inflicting obstacles and fulfill your destiny to unlock the next level, and the one after that one, until you have completed all the levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own route through the level!</li><li>5 different cubes to summon!</li><li>Over 55 levels!</li><li>57 levels!</li><li>Many different traps to navigate!</li><li>Many ways to die!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore the serene world of lab 83 with its lovely blades, spikes, boulders and more. Summon cubes for literally no reason to get through the death-inflicting obstacles and fulfill your destiny to unlock the next level, and the one after that one, until you have completed all the levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own route through the level!</li><li>5 different cubes to summon!</li><li>Over 55 levels!</li><li>57 levels!</li><li>Many different traps to navigate!</li><li>Many ways to die!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 2.5D person puzzle game with creative puzzle solving. Put your own blocks into the level to get past deadly traps to the level exit without getting mangled. Complete levels quickly or with few blocks to get achievements!",
